issue_context.body:
The `WebApplicationBuilder` should automatically register the `DeveloperExceptionPageMiddleware` in the pipeline by default. The middleware should be added before any other middleware in the pipeline and only when the current environment is development, i.e. when `IWebHostEnvironment.IsDevlopment() == true`.

The empty web template should be updated as part of this to remove the existing lines of code that explicitly add the middleware to the pipeline from the application, e.g.:

``` diff
var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
var app = builder.Build();

-if (app.Environment.IsDevelopment())
-{
-    app.UseDeveloperExceptionPage();
-}

app.MapGet("/", "Hello World");

app.Run();
```
